              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "# Loaded Skill: kai-career (skill)\n\nKai's career framing - hard-no verticals, location and employment rules, comp rules and the standing rule against inventing them, portfolio gap, life-planning. Read before any comp number.\n\n## Content\n\n# Career framing\n\nKai's career filters, comp/equity stance, history, portfolio gap, and life-planning form. Read the relevant reference before recommending roles, drafting interview prep, suggesting projects, or running a life-planning pass.\n\n## Section pointers\n\n- [`references/verticals-and-location.md`](references/verticals-and-location.md) - hard-no verticals (crypto, defense/surveillance, legacy tech, no-Bay-Area-office) and location / employment rules (remote office requirement, onsite cadence, employment type).\n- [`references/comp-and-equity.md`](references/comp-and-equity.md) - comp is not load-bearing, the sector-split floor ($170K nonprofit and government, $200K otherwise) with $250K as the top anchor, and equity is not load-bearing.\n- `coilyco-bridge/lore/docs/personal-context.md` - private identity, career history, professional arc, and life context.\n- [`references/portfolio-gap.md`](references/portfolio-gap.md) - bio claims vs repo evidence, how to apply on build/OSS prompts, named constraints, and the eco-telemetry o11y lever.\n- [`references/life-planning-and-lore.md`](references/life-planning-and-lore.md) - the life-planning pass form (4-part synthesis, gate, voice) and the private Lore sources for personal questions.\n\n## How to apply\n\n- **Recommending roles / triaging JDs:** run the verticals and location filters first ([`references/verticals-and-location.md`](references/verticals-and-location.md)). Auto-filter the hard-nos, don't surface them.\n- **Interview / negotiation prep:** treat comp and equity as not load-bearing ([`references/comp-and-equity.md`](references/comp-and-equity.md)). Don't anchor comp above $250K without specific evidence.\n- **Writing any outer text that could carry a number or a reason:** read [`references/comp-and-equity.md`](references/comp-and-equity.md) first. Never volunteer a comp figure, never steer toward the top figure, and never attribute a job change to on-call load. Both are standing agent-invention failures Kai has flagged.\n- **New-project / side-project / OSS / \"what should I build next\" prompts:** surface the portfolio gap in one line and bias toward closing it ([`references/portfolio-gap.md`](references/portfolio-gap.md)). Remind on the eco-telemetry o11y lever when relevant.\n- **\"Life planning\" / \"check in on my life\" / \"where am I at\":** produce the cross-domain synthesis form, gated on current repo and tracker evidence ([`references/life-planning-and-lore.md`](references/life-planning-and-lore.md)).\n- **Any personal question (life, identity, values, health, career arc, preferences):** Lore is the durable private source - check the relevant entry before answering or asking ([`references/life-planning-and-lore.md`](references/life-planning-and-lore.md)).\n\n## Supporting Files\n\nSkill directory: /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-old-2/.agents/skills/kai-career\n\nRelative paths in this skill resolve from the skill directory. The shell tool runs in the session working directory, so use the resolved path below or `cd` into the skill directory before running supporting scripts.\n\n- references/comp-and-equity.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-old-2/.agents/skills/kai-career/references/comp-and-equity.md (load_skill(name: \"kai-career/references/comp-and-equity.md\"))\n- references/verticals-and-location.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-old-2/.agents/skills/kai-career/references/verticals-and-location.md (load_skill(name: \"kai-career/references/verticals-and-location.md\"))\n- references/portfolio-gap.md → /private/var/folder