                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Installed 4 packages in 24ms\n1.\ntitle       Best MCP Gateways & AI Agent Security 2026 | Toolradar\nhref        https://toolradar.com/guides/best-mcp-gateways\nbody        Jun 5, 2026 · The 6 best MCP gateways and AI agent security tools in 2026.\n            Grounded reviews of Lakera, Noma, Operant AI, Prompt Security,\n            Pillar, and Lasso for securing agentic workloads.\n2.\ntitle       Best MCP Gateways and AI Agent Security Tools (2026)\nhref        https://www.integrate.io/blog/best-mcp-gateways-and-ai-agent-security-tools/\nbody        Sep 14, 2026 · This guide examines the 15 best solutions for securing AI\n            agents in 2026, spanning enterprise MCP gateways and dedicated\n            security platforms. We analyzed 45+ solutions across certification\n            status, performance benchmarks, integration breadth, and real-\n            world deployment evidence.\n3.\ntitle       MCP Security & Agent Guardrails — AI Agent Permissions\nhref        https://aerostack.dev/agent-security\nbody        MCP security refers to enforcing what MCP servers and tools an AI agent is\n            permitted to call, and under what conditions. Without it, any MCP\n            server you connect gives the agent unrestricted access — to your\n            database, repos, cloud, and APIs.\n4.\ntitle       7 Best Agentic AI Security Solutions in 2026\nhref        https://cybersecuritynews.com/best-agentic-ai-security-solutions-2026/\nbody        Jul 6, 2026 · The broader platform covers AI asset discovery (shadow AI and\n            MCP servers), adaptive runtime guardrails, and governance\n            automation. Pillar was named a Representative Vendor in the 2026\n            Gartner Market Guide for Guardian Agents, and it assembled the\n            SAIL framework — the first process-driven guide for AI security\n            roadmaps.\n5.\ntitle       Best AI Agent Guardrails Platforms 2026 - futureagi.com\nhref        https:/